<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Home - Classroom</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="https://gstatic.com">
    <style>
        :root { --bg-dark: #0b0b0c; --panel-bg: #16161a; --accent-blue: #00bcff; --orange-bar: #ff6b00; }
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: var(--bg-dark); color: #fff; margin: 0; padding: 0; overflow: hidden; height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
        
        .orange-announcement { background: var(--orange-bar); color: #fff; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; position: relative; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
        .orange-announcement .close-btn { position: absolute; right: 20px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); cursor: pointer; color: #fff; }

        .virtual-browser-bar { background-color: #121214; padding: 8px 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid #222; }
        .browser-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
        .nav-btn { background: #222; border: none; color: #fff; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; }
        .nav-btn:hover { background: #333; }
        .address-bar-input { background: #1a1a1e; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 20px; padding: 6px 20px; width: 450px; color: #fff; outline: none; font-size: 13px; text-align: left; }

        .desktop-viewport { flex: 1; display: flex; position: relative; background-image: radial-gradient(#1e1e24 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 24px 24px; overflow: hidden; }
        
        .sidebar-dock { width: 60px; background: #121214; border-right: 1px solid #222; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding-top: 20px; gap: 15px; }
        .dock-icon { width: 34px; height: 34px; background: #222; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; cursor: pointer; font-size: 16px; transition: 0.2s; }
        .dock-icon:hover { background: var(--accent-blue); transform: scale(1.05); }

        .desktop-content { flex: 1; padding: 30px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; overflow-y: auto; box-sizing: border-box; }
        
        .welcome-panel { background: rgba(22, 22, 26, 0.95); border: 1px solid #2d2d35; border-radius: 16px; padding: 30px; max-width: 850px; width: 100%; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.7); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .main-heading { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
        .heading-blue { color: var(--accent-blue); }

        .apps-shortcut-row { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 25px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .shortcut-tile { width: 65px; height: 65px; background: #25252b; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #333; transition: 0.2s; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; }
        .shortcut-tile:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--accent-blue); }

        .section-title { text-align: left; width: 100%; max-width: 850px; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; margin: 25px 0 5px 0; color: #fff; }
        .section-subtitle { text-align: left; width: 100%; max-width: 850px; color: #aaa; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .activities-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(190px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; max-width: 850px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        
        .activity-card { background: #1c1c22; border: 1px solid #2d2d35; border-radius: 12px; padding: 25px 15px; text-align: center; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; transition: all 0.2s ease; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 90px; box-sizing: border-box; }
        .activity-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .card-g { background: #ffffff; color: #000; }
        .card-yt { background: #ffffff; color: #ff0000; }
        .card-twitch { background: #6441a5; color: #fff; }
        .card-poki { background: #34a853; color: #fff; }

        .workspace-frame-container { width: 100%; max-width: 850px; border: 2px solid #2d2d35; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: #000; margin-top: 20px; display: none; }
        .workspace-frame-container iframe { width: 100%; height: 600px; border: none; display: block; background: #fff; }

        .admin-box-lock { width: 100%; max-width: 850px; background: #16161a; border: 1px dashed #444; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-top: 40px; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; }
        .admin-box-lock input, .admin-box-lock select { padding: 12px; background: #222; border: 1px solid #333; color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; margin: 8px 0; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; }
        
        .login-overlay { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; background: #0b0b0c; z-index: 1000; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    </style>
    <script>
        function openSystemUrl(url) {
            document.getElementById('display-canvas-wrapper').style.display = 'block';
            const iframe = document.getElementById('workspace-viewport');
            iframe.src = url;
            document.getElementById('current-address-bar').value = url;
            iframe.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' });
        }

        function openInAboutBlank() {
            const pageUrl = window.location.href;
            const ghostWindow = window.open('about:blank', '_blank');
            if (ghostWindow) {
                ghostWindow.document.open();
                ghostWindow.document.write(`
                    <!DOCTYPE html>
                    <html>
                    <head>
                        <title>Home - Classroom</title>
                        <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="https://gstatic.com">
                        <style>html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; background-color: #121212; } iframe { border: none; width: 100%; height: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; }</style>
                    </head>
                    <body>
                        <iframe src="${pageUrl}" allowfullscreen="true" allow="autoplay; fullscreen"></iframe>
                    </body>
                    </html>
                `);
                ghostWindow.document.close();
            }
        }

        function verifyLoginSession(event) {
            event.preventDefault();
            document.getElementById('gatekeeper-login').style.display = 'none';
            
            const emailInput = document.getElementById('session-email').value.trim().toLowerCase();
            if (emailInput === "y.madrid10018@gmail.com") {
                document.getElementById('owner-console').style.display = 'block';
            }
        }
    </script>
</head>
<body>

    <div id="gatekeeper-login" class="login-overlay">
        <div class="welcome-panel" style="max-width: 450px;">
            <div class="main-heading" style="font-size: 26px;">Welcome to <span class="heading-blue">Art Class Enhanced</span></div>
            <form onsubmit="verifyLoginSession(event)">
                <input type="email" id="session-email" placeholder="Enter student email to verify..." required style="width: 100%; padding: 14px; background: #222; border: 1px solid #333; color: #fff; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 15px; box-sizing: border-box;">
                <button type="submit" style="width: 100%; padding: 14px; background: #00e676; border: none; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer;">PLAY / ENTRAR</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="orange-announcement">
        [10/19/2026] Reimplemented emulator and added toasts... No more updates this month. Is something broken? <span style="text-decoration: underline; cursor: pointer;">Join Discord!</span>
        <span class="close-btn">[Close]</span>
    </div>

    <div class="virtual-browser-bar">
        <div class="browser-actions">
            <button class="nav-btn" onclick="location.reload()">🏠 Exit / Home</button>
            <button class="nav-btn" onclick="openInAboutBlank()" style="background: #007bff;">🚀 Open in About:Blank</button>
            <button class="nav-btn" style="background: #ff4d4d;">⚙️ Panic Button</button>
        </div>
        <input type="text" id="current-address-bar" class="address-bar-input" value="about:blank" readonly>
        <div style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; color: #aaa;">12:19 PM</div>
    </div>

    <div class="desktop-viewport">
        <div class="sidebar-dock">
            <div class="dock-icon" onclick="location.reload()">🏠</div>
            <div class="dock-icon" onclick="openInAboutBlank()">🚀</div>
            <div class="dock-icon">🎮</div>
            <div class="dock-icon">📥</div>
            <div class="dock-icon">ℹ️</div>
        </div>

        <div class="desktop-content">
            <div class="welcome-panel">
                <div class="main-heading">Welcome to <span class="heading-blue">Art Class Enhanced</span></div>
                
                <div class="apps-shortcut-row">
                    <div class="shortcut-tile" onclick="openSystemUrl('https://freeorion.org')">🎮</div>
                    <div class="shortcut-tile" onclick="openSystemUrl('https://twoplayergames.org')">🏀</div>
